{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54815","headline":"兵要望江南 占地第十五（二十一首） 十五 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占地第十五（二十一首） 十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城营内，地动起兵戈。\n且早移营於吉地（辛本、川本作「福上」），不然刑祸将身多，阵败（辛本、川本、京本作「破」）自消磨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54815.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54815","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}